<title>POLAND: Rafako turns to loss in Q1.</title>
<headline>Rafako turns to loss in Q1.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rafako SA preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating loss			  5.31  vs    5.78 profit</p>
<p>    pre-tax loss			    7.51  vs    2.71 profit</p>
<p>    net loss				  7.51  vs    1.57 profit</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Fabryka Kotlow Rafako SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				77.39  vs   98.03</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 70.26  vs   92.66</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		    1.70  vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				0.00  vs    1.14</p>
<p>    other taxes			     0.00  vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    5.12  vs    0.53</p>
<p>    financial costs			 7.32  vs    3.61</p>
<p>    investment				0.43  vs    2.08</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
